WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:07.613
"I'm the best jumper!" Cupcake said.

2
00:00:07.614 --> 00:00:12.329
Pickle snorted. "I'm better."

3
00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:22.723
"Grr!" Cupcake made fists.

4
00:00:22.724 --> 00:00:29.882
Popcorn and Noodles came over.

5
00:00:29.883 --> 00:00:33.280
"What's going on?" Popcorn asked.

6
00:00:33.281 --> 00:00:37.649
"Pickle was bragging," Cupcake said.

7
00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:43.789
"So were you!" Pickle said.

8
00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:48.041
"You shouldn't brag," Popcorn said.

9
00:00:48.042 --> 00:00:52.288
"Well, I'm good at jumping," Pickle said.

10
00:00:52.289 --> 00:00:59.307
"I run the fastest too."

11
00:00:59.308 --> 00:01:02.849
"No, you don't," Noodles said.

12
00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.234
"I'm faster than you."

13
00:01:06.235 --> 00:01:11.441
Popcorn grinned. "And I'm even faster!"

14
00:01:11.442 --> 00:01:23.899
Noodles frowned. "No, you're not!"

15
00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:27.601
Berry rolled his eyes.

16
00:01:27.602 --> 00:01:32.234
"Can we just have fun?"

17
00:01:32.235 --> 00:01:37.472
"I'll race you!" Pickle ran.

18
00:01:37.473 --> 00:01:39.411
Noodles ran.

19
00:01:39.412 --> 00:01:49.970
Popcorn ran.

20
00:01:49.971 --> 00:01:55.250
"Oof!" Popcorn's foot hit a spoon.

21
00:01:55.251 --> 00:02:01.943
The others kept running.

22
00:02:01.944 --> 00:02:10.913
"No fair!" Popcorn yelled. "I tripped!"

23
00:02:10.914 --> 00:02:14.079
"Ugh," Berry said.

24
00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:17.053
"Please stop arguing!"

25
00:02:17.054 --> 00:02:20.906
"Yeah!" Cupcake said.

26
00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:24.342
"Thank you, Cupcake," Berry said.

27
00:02:24.343 --> 00:02:26.656
"It doesn't matter who's—"

28
00:02:26.657 --> 00:02:31.862
"Let's have a big contest instead!" Cupcake said.

29
00:02:31.863 --> 00:02:35.930
"Tomorrow!"

